          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gime je otimere ri Kere Nebukadineza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rumacen ma gike ma dwe mar'apar g'ario go oyido wotho i wi kisul ot ma muluwir ma Babilon, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aka owaco ni, “Me ki Babilon madwoŋ, m'atieko geto paka ot ma ker gi meni paran kodi ri dwoŋ ma dhum paran!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kucel munyo wac no fodi k'opodho wok i dhok kere, dwondi mogo owok i polo ka waco ni, “Awi Kere Nebukadineza, oluwi kwoŋin ni, otiek mayin ker! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilakwanyin woko wok i dier ji aka ilabedo g'ogwaŋe madudi. Ilamiyin camo lum paka megikwe ma oro abirio cuka inoŋey nike Jamalo swa dhumo ker pa ji aka nike go miyo dhum ri ŋata go yero.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
