            "sid": "DAN 4:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gi piyo no won wac no otundo i kare kwoŋ Nebukadineza. Okwany go woko i dier ji, ocamo lum paka megikwe, delkwoŋe odhiekere gi thoyo ma polo, cuka yer kwoŋe odongo paka yer ango aka lwete olokere lwet winyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nebukadineza pako Were",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
